                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No.312.11/1354A.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to American Consular Officers in
                        Mexico.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-04-23">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 23, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department’s instructions of November 25, 1912. Prepare a supplementary report,
                    bringing up to date the general report made by you in compliance with those
                    instructions.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
